# A screw thread made through its screen on an extruded circle; the
# same model as path_thread.go makes (TestPathEquivalence/thread).
key c
move 300 300
down L 300 300
up L 300 300
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
key esc
key x shift
# Its depth held and typed as 80 on its screen: the model was drawn
# for a deep part, deeper than a new extrusion of this sketch starts.
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
twmove 501 125
twdown L 501 125
twup L 501 125
edit 80
move 350 300
down L 350 300
up L 350 300
menu Features|Screw Thread...
# The designation, the length, an internal thread, then make it.
twmove 172 110
twdown L 172 110
twup L 172 110
edit M6x1
twmove 220 150
twdown L 220 150
twup L 220 150
edit 9
twmove 181 190
twdown L 181 190
twup L 181 190
# Flip the direction: against the circle's normal, down into the part.
twmove 60 230
twdown L 60 230
twup L 60 230
twmove 37 260
twdown L 37 260
twup L 37 260
